  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The new invite icons are all the same colour and outline. There is almost no functional visual difference between them. With more icons this is only going to cause further confusion.\nEach icon has a distinct (but related) behaviour and it should be able to discern which is which at a very quick glance, often as handling these is done  as a secondary activity during a conversation.\nThis can be easily fixed with either additional colours (within the colour-blind friendly range), or much more clearly distinct shapes. A small icon on the same shape is insufficient.",
